  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞菇\" width=\"100%\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=请我喝咖啡&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝咖啡\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=成为赞助者&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=加入Discord社区&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入Discord社区\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=维基百科&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"维基百科\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞菇是Friends&amp;Foes模组的一个小型扩展，为每种花朵添加了对应的哞菇变种。哞菇可以在草甸和繁花森林生物群系中找到。您可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>获取更多关于哞菇的信息。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">🐮 哞菇变种</span></p><hr><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">绒球葱</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蓝花美耳草</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" alt=\"绒球葱哞菇\" width=\"133\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" alt=\"蓝花美耳草哞菇\" width=\"146\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蓝 Orchid</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">矢车菊</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" alt=\"蓝 Orchid 哞菇\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" alt=\"矢车菊哞菇\" width=\"139\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">蒲公英</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">丁香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" alt=\"蒲公英哞菇\" width=\"149\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" alt=\"丁香哞菇\" width=\"144\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">铃兰</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">橙色郁金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" alt=\"铃兰哞菇\" width=\"140\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" alt=\"橙色郁金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">滨菊</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">牡丹</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" alt=\"滨菊哞菇\" width=\"134\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" alt=\"牡丹哞菇\" width=\"150\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">粉色郁金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">虞美人</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" alt=\"粉色郁金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" alt=\"虞美人哞菇\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">红色郁金香</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">玫瑰丛</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" alt=\"红色郁金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" alt=\"玫瑰丛哞菇\" width=\"142\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">向日葵</span></p>\n</td>\n<td><img width=\"419\" height=\"1\">\n<p><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold\">白色郁金香</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" alt=\"向日葵哞菇\" width=\"150\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" alt=\"白色郁金香哞菇\" width=\"137\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 其他扩展/数据包</span></p><hr><ul>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 养蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社区</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎<a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的Discord社区</a>进行交流、分享您的创作、提出任何问题，或及时了解模组的最新开发动态并在新版本发布时获得通知。同时，也请随时<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过GitHub问题报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">无论是否获得支持，我都会继续开发我的模组，因为这是我的爱好，而且我的大部分空闲时间都投入到了模组开发中。但如果您仍想支持我，可以通过<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>进行支持。在此感谢所有支持者。</span></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 许可证</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组采用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>许可证。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎参考我的代码示例，了解我在编写此模组时如何实现和解决各种问题，并将代码片段融入您自己的项目中。同时，也欢迎在任何整合包中使用此模组（如能注明出处/链接至本页面将不胜感激）。</span></p>",
